                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bca7a717-aeb1-4d5a-aba2-a5cdeed72481",
                                "sense_id": "b31241a3-6037-3a2a-8993-cd2929808e01",
                                "text": "— Каки́е э́то цветы́ Павлу́ша? — спроси́л он, пока́зывая Воло́дину на жёлтые цвето́чки у забо́ра в чьём-то саду́.\n— Э́то — лю́тики, Арда́ша, — печа́льно отве́тил Воло́дин.",
                                "translation": "\" What sort of flowers are those, Pavloushka ? \" he asked as he pointed out to Volodin some small yellow flowers by a garden fence.\n\" That's liutiki,* Ardasha,\" said Volodin sadly.",
                                "english": "\" What sort of flowers are those, Pavloushka ? \" he asked as he pointed out to Volodin some small yellow flowers by a garden fence.\n\" That's liutiki,* Ardasha,\" said Volodin sadly."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
